  "prompt": "For each product launched on or after 1 January 2024, how many units did it sell in its first 7 days on sale? The launch day is day 1 and the 7th day is the last; place each sale on its UTC order day. A product that sold nothing in those days shows 0. Return two columns, in this order: product_id, and first_week_units. Return one row for each product launched on or after 1 January 2024. Any row order is fine.",
